  &lt;div class="gh-btn-container"&gt;&lt;a class="gh-btn" href="https://github.com/17J/rajasthan-desert-greening-tracker" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;View on GitHub&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
